        "7711500..7711518: copy display string then7713350 appends space, then append to version",
        "771153c..771157c build fallback and rightParen"
      ],
      "limitation": "Use the independently built host Bundle values; original artifact version is evidence provenance, not the host installed version. OAICommitHash adjacent initializer7711a0c is not consumed by this formatter."
